{"4261080":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Expedition of the Guild","steam_appid":4261080,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>Join the Community!<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/32bd6eeed74a2d885eff2b1ef54d16fe.avif?t=1793618696\" width=800 height=120 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/bf8f79a5b6e697f9c9bf84bcbc1b9d3a.avif?t=1793618696\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras_big\/bf8f79a5b6e697f9c9bf84bcbc1b9d3a.avif?t=1793618696 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/cb4425253b70a5de5596a6f095551b49.avif?t=1793618696\" width=800 height=154 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own guild and recruit heroes during your journey: Paladins, Mages, Hunters, Priests, and more. Tanks, DPS, and Healers all play important roles in raids. Unlock talent trees, collect powerful gear, and grow your team from a small party into a legendary guild renowned throughout the land!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/f73677a5be182674ac1dc90dd82251cc.poster.avif?t=1793618696\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/f73677a5be182674ac1dc90dd82251cc.webm?t=1793618696\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/f73677a5be182674ac1dc90dd82251cc.mp4?t=1793618696\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/974290fa324d6e1a19958662ce48ef48.avif?t=1793618696\" width=800 height=154 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose durable Tanks, powerful DPS builds, and skilled healers to keep your party alive. Build your party your way: Choose safe and balanced raid setups, rush levels with high-damage teams, or experiment with fun combinations to push your limits. Pick your lineup before every raid and overcome challenges through teamwork and strategy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/3fd690c7716960a766beecdf158c5aed.poster.avif?t=1793618696\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/3fd690c7716960a766beecdf158c5aed.webm?t=1793618696\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/3fd690c7716960a766beecdf158c5aed.mp4?t=1793618696\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/6e962d465e615d5359704a10e717f448.avif?t=1793618696\" width=800 height=154 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight towering giants and ancient gods hidden within ruins. Every BOSS features unique mechanics and intense battles. Defeat them to loot chests and powerful class-based gear. No random loot rolls — you decide how every reward is distributed. Build the perfect endgame setup for your heroes and enjoy the thrill of classic MMORPG raids once again!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/496baf1ce4f8aca3b5d325c25956385f.poster.avif?t=1793618696\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/496baf1ce4f8aca3b5d325c25956385f.webm?t=1793618696\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/496baf1ce4f8aca3b5d325c25956385f.mp4?t=1793618696\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/bf8f79a5b6e697f9c9bf84bcbc1b9d3a.avif?t=1793618696\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras_big\/bf8f79a5b6e697f9c9bf84bcbc1b9d3a.avif?t=1793618696 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261080\/extras\/cb4425253b70a5de5596a6f095551b49.avif?t=1793618696\" width=800 height=154 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own guild and recruit heroes during your journey: Paladins, Mages, Hunters, Priests, and more. Tanks, DPS, and Healers all play important roles in raids. Unlock talent trees, collect powerful gear, and grow your team from a small party 